	{
		id: "metro-kingdom",
		coords: [-40.3, 23],

		label: "Metro Kingdom",
		icon: "default",
		path: "data/maps/globe/assets/waypoints/metro-kingdom/",

		displayType: "pamphlet",

		content: {
			left: [
				{
					type: "header",
					title: "Metro Kingdom",
					tagline: "The Big Banana",
					image: "header.png",
				},		
				{
					type: "appeared-table",
					firstAppeared: {
						game: "Donkey Kong",
						year: 1981,
						link: "https://www.mariowiki.com/Donkey_Kong_(game)"
					},
					lastAppeared: {
						game: "Donkey Kong Bananza",
						year: 2025,
						link: "https://www.mariowiki.com/Donkey_Kong_Bananza"
					}
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					content: "The modern commerce center and urban playground, the Metro Kingdom is a vast and bustling web of cities and skyscrapers. Its most famous location, New Donk City, is the home of the famous rivalry between Mario and Donkey Kong; now governed by Mayor Pauline. It is constantly under construction, with the iconic red girders scaling every street! ",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
				{
					type: "image",
					alignImage: "center",
					image: "new_donk.jpg",
					caption: "New Donk City",
					alignCaption: "center",
				},
				{
					type: "horizontal-rule",
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					title: "Retro Beginnings",
					content: "This here is where Mario took up his first jobs! As a carpenter Mario fought Donkey Kong; then he and Luigi worked in a bottling plant; before proceeding to work in a Cement Factory; next serving in the military; a brief stint as part of a Wrecking Crew; until eventually settling in his role as a plumber - cleaning the pipes of the city.",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
				{
					type: "carousel",
					images: [
						{
							image: "dk_arcade.png",
							caption: "Donkey Kong Arcade"
						},
						{
							image: "mario_bros_gw.jpg",
							caption: "Mario Bros. Game & Watch"
						},
						{
