					type: "image-left",
					image: "forest.png",
					imageWidth: "230px",
					caption: "Forest",
					title: "Big City",
					titleColor: "#b18f01",
					content: "We see more of the various skyscrapers and apartments in Donkey Kong for the Game Boy! We also see the large forest just outside the city."
