					title: "Neon Heights",
					titleOnTop: true,
					titleColor: "#b18f01",
					content: "Beyond New Donk City we find the the bright lights of Neon Heights! Atop of these skyscrapers has its own theatre district, a movie set, a space center and a baseball diamond! Not to mention the large Mario of Liberty statue!"
