	{
		id: "mario-kart-world",
		coords: [-62.5, -143.5],

		label: "Mario Kart World",
		icon: "default",
		path: "data/maps/globe/assets/waypoints/mario-kart-world/",

		displayType: "pamphlet",

		content: {
			left: [
				{
					type: "header",
					title: "Mario Kart World",
					tagline: "The place to race",
					image: "crown_city.webp",
				},
				{
					type: "explore-button",
					target: "mario-kart-world",
				},		
				{
					type: "appeared-table",
					appeared: {
						game: "Mario Kart World",
						year: 2025,
						link: "https://www.mariowiki.com/Mario_Kart_World"
					},
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					content: "Not to be confused with Circuit Break Island, Mario Kart World is a continent dedicated to racing! It is a large interconnected hub of different biomes and race tracks, pulling from Mario's long history of Go-Karting.  Across the isle you will find sunny shores, beautiful fall forests, lush savannahs, dandelion winds, glistening peaks, wild west badlands, volcanic castles and Moo-Moo filled plains. Behind the racing is a fully functioning world too, with the varied inhabitants coexisting in this karting paradise.",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
				{
					type: "carousel",
					images: [
						{
							image: "sunny_shores.png",
							caption: "Peach Beach"
						},
						{
							image: "fall_forests.png",
							caption: "Cheep Cheep Lake"
						},
						{
							image: "lush_savannah.png",
							caption: "Faraway Oasis"
						},
						{
							image: "dandelion_winds.jpg",
							caption: "Dandelion Depths"
						},
						{
							image: "snow_peaks.jpg",
							caption: "DK Pass"
						},
						{
							image: "badlands.png",
							caption: "Mario Circuit"
						},
						{
							image: "volcanic_castles.jpg",
							caption: "Dry Bones Burnout"
						},
						{
							image: "moo_moo.jpeg",
							caption: "Moo Moo Meadows"
						},
					]
				},
				{
					type: "horizontal-rule"
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					content: "Across the continent is over 202 unique intermission tracks, and 30 specialised routes for racing! They consist of spectacular new locations like the DK Spaceport and Acorn Heights; as well as recreations of classic locations such as Moo Moo meadows, Shy Guy Bazaar and Peach Beach. Scattered across the world are 394 P Switches,  150 ?-Panels and 200 Peach Medallions to collect!",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
				{
					type: "image",
					alignImage: "center",
					image: "world_map.avif",
					caption: "World Map",
					alignCaption: "center",
				},
				{
					type: "horizontal-rule"
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					title: "Crown City",
					titleColor: "#b18f01",
					content: "See the sights and structures of Crown City. You can even soar in style down main street. There are many wonderful landmarks to enjoy! There is the large trophy-shaped statue with a crowned tire on top that serves as the highest point in the city and what it was named after. The large suspension bridge “Crown Bridge” connects the city to the Faraway Oasis. There are many brands and shops to visit:",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
				{
					type: "list",
					content: [
						"Bank Coin Coffer",
						"Birdo Jewelry",
