					content: "In the Mesa is a giant mountain themed after steam trains! A huge locomotive chimney extends from its centre, filling the sky with steam, as you race between the trains and the rails. The trains are a part of the Sunshine Railway brand, and Whistlestop Summit is the base station that connects the rest of the island - known as Wilderness coast Station!",
