					content: "At the center of the continent is the grand Peach Stadium! An elaborate pink and white castle resembling Peach's home in Toad Town, is the hub of racing, with pretty gardens and a beautiful star shaped lake. It has a train and bus station with a sign labeled Peach Stadium Terminal, located directly underneath the main track.",
