					}
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					content: "The Sprixie Kingdom is a series of islands between two larger landmasses, inhabited by the Sprixies and ruled by the Sprixie Princesses. This fairy kingdom is connected to the Mushroom continent by a sparkling clear pipe - which cover the land! Additionally these islands are the home of the Cat Bell and the Double Cherry, unique power-ups that shape the culture and life of the region.",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
