					content: "There are 6 core islands that make up the Sprixie Kingdom, which have a rough theme but can vary drastically in their contents. There is a green grassy isle, a yellow desert, a blue snowy world, an orange canyon realm, purple beaches and a cyan island of clouds. They are ruled by the colorful Sprixie princesses!",
