					imageWidth: "230px",
					caption: "Egg Island",
					title: "Egg Island",
					titleColor: "#b18f01",
					content: "An island that rests atop of a giant floating sphere of sea! A floating paradise that acts as a second home for the Yoshi Clan. "
				},
				{
					type: "text",
					title: "Fruit Archipelago",
					titleColor: "#b18f01",
					content: "Giant fruits are prevalent throughout many of the isles, with some exceptionally large ones forming a collection of islands, such as the Megafruit Paradise, and the Watermelon and Cantaloupe Islands.",
					alignContent: "left",
				},
				{
					type: "carousel",
