					title: "Luigi and the Marvelous Compass",
					titleColor: "#b18f01",
					content: "During The Thousand-Year Door saga, Luigi finds himself on his own grand quest: to rescue Princess Eclair of the Waffle Kingdom! This sends him to a slew of locations near Rogueport such as: ",
					alignContent: "left",
